  "geometry_notes": [
   "W is measured at the soffit working point. 4\" bottom flange projecting 6\" beyond an upper body of width W - 12 and height H - 4 with 2\" top chamfers.",
   "Flange edge: 1/2\" draft (inward towards the top), 1/2\" chamfer at the top corner and 3/4\" chamfer at the soffit corner (Flange Detail).",
   "The re-entrant '3/4\" fillet' is modelled as a 3/4\" 45-degree fill (chamfer): this reproduces the published areas to 0.01 in2 (a circular fillet would be 0.32 in2 low).",
   "Each tabulated width (13 per depth) is a separate profile with its own published properties; the three depths share one drawing each.",
   "Pinned source discrepancy: 18\" FSB 5'-0\" Iyy printed 195,689 in4; the polygon gives 196,689 (+0.51 %), and the neighbouring rows' increments (+10,397, +10,834 for 4'-10\"/4'-11\") imply ~196,700: probably a one-digit typo in the SPI table."
  ],
